  "solution": {
    "text": "<table border=\"1px solid\">\t<thead>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></th>\t\t\t<th><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math></th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi>p</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>q</mi></math></th>\t\t\t<th><math><mi>p</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></th>\t\t</tr>\t</thead>\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is true<br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mi>q</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is true<br />Now, common between<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is<br /><math><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∧</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct<br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∧</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∧</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo></math> Only <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>p</mi></math> or only <math><mi>q</mi><mo>≡</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  }
